## 理论上的 KL 散度

$$KL(\pi_\text{actor} \| \pi_\text{student}) = \mathbb{E}_{x \sim \pi_\text{actor}} \left[ \log \pi_\text{actor}(x) - \log \pi_\text{student}(x) \right] \geq 0$$

